00:36:38.000 --> 00:36:39.120
in the first place

00:36:39.120 --> 00:36:40.940
if they weren't going to try

00:36:40.940 --> 00:36:43.260
and work into some story beats

00:36:43.260 --> 00:36:44.240
of Tom Sawyer

00:36:44.240 --> 00:36:47.920
