But it did have some ideas,

00:37:00.200 --> 00:37:01.660
and usually when I say that,

00:37:01.740 --> 00:37:03.120
that means that they weren't executed well.

00:37:04.460 --> 00:37:05.260
But obviously,

00:37:05.260 --> 00:37:06.400
this game is not essential.

00:37:07.580 --> 00:37:08.860
It's Tom Sawyer.

